        "rationale": "Clause (ii) in F001 imposes the requirement to include the applicant's name and reference number specifically on electronic requests under clause (i) of that section (F000). It does not apply to inspecting public records under clause (i) of the subsequent section (F003). Imposing this condition on public record inspections is entirely ungrounded.",
